WEBVTT

00:12.480 --> 00:13.860
Has something happened?

00:18.700 --> 00:20.790
There's absolutely no hope in sight.

00:20.790 --> 00:22.680
Is this about His Highness?

00:24.800 --> 00:27.090
Apparently, it's more in his nature to invade

00:27.090 --> 00:30.940
and take control of another country
 instead of joining forces with them.

00:32.880 --> 00:33.980
Really?

00:35.180 --> 00:37.090
He said that?

01:00.510 --> 01:01.950
<i>At last, I've found him.</i>

01:03.710 --> 01:04.960
<i>Someone who understands poison...</i>

01:06.280 --> 01:09.260
<i>a sovereign who might use it the right way.</i>

02:51.980 --> 02:55.450
<i>If the negotiations with 
Prince Arnold fail like this,</i>

02:55.450 --> 02:57.990
<i>Coyolles might be invaded.</i>

02:59.000 --> 03:00.460
<i>And if that happens...</i>

03:02.060 --> 03:04.150
You're enthusiastic for 
this early in the morning.

03:04.880 --> 03:06.220
Lord Lawvine.

03:07.530 --> 03:10.080
But I see hesitation in your sword.

03:13.020 --> 03:14.140
The truth is...

03:14.800 --> 03:17.460
my thoughts had turned 
in an unworthy direction.

03:17.900 --> 03:20.220
By unworthy, you mean...

03:21.280 --> 03:25.720
If one day we go to war with another country,

03:26.280 --> 03:29.250
everyone here will go 
into battle, won't they?

03:29.920 --> 03:31.060
They will.

03:33.070 --> 03:36.290
I find myself afraid of a future like that.

03:37.430 --> 03:39.620
It's only natural to find it terrifying.

03:39.620 --> 03:40.490
What?

03:41.150 --> 03:45.210
My son lost his life in the last war.

03:45.960 --> 03:49.310
I'm proud of my son for fighting so bravely.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.140
However...

03:53.090 --> 03:55.280
in equal measure to that sense of pride...

03:55.970 --> 03:58.810
I wish that my son had lived.

03:59.750 --> 04:01.180
Lord Lawvine.

04:02.240 --> 04:05.360
A war means that people will 
be robbed of their futures.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.760
Others will steal them away.

04:07.620 --> 04:11.140
To conquer the fear of that, 
one can only stand and fight.

04:12.380 --> 04:14.280
Stand and fight?

04:15.670 --> 04:19.230
I mean that you shouldn't deny 
your own hopes and feelings.

04:19.860 --> 04:24.150
You should use them as fuel to move forward.

04:24.900 --> 04:27.310
"What is it that I can do?"

04:27.980 --> 04:29.930
Find the answer to that question.

04:33.360 --> 04:35.730
Thank you, Lord Lawvine!

04:36.400 --> 04:38.280
Then, I shall see you later.

04:43.100 --> 04:45.840
<i>I don't want to die in some war.</i>

04:46.250 --> 04:48.390
<i>I don't want Coyolles to fall into ruin.</i>

04:49.220 --> 04:51.680
<i>But that isn't all.</i>

04:52.140 --> 04:54.520
Rather than joining hands 
with another country,

04:54.520 --> 04:57.230
invading and taking control of it...

04:57.550 --> 04:59.440
that suits me much better.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.150
<i>You aren't that kind of person.</i>

05:03.780 --> 05:06.760
<i>I want you to understand that, Prince Arnold.</i>

05:10.960 --> 05:15.750
And so, we have a special 
observer for your training,

05:16.580 --> 05:19.000
the Crown Prince of the Empire,

05:19.680 --> 05:21.900
Prince Arnold Hein.

05:21.900 --> 05:24.510
<i>Why is Prince Arnold here?!</i>

05:32.800 --> 05:35.890
<i>No matter how you look at 
this, I've been found out!</i>

05:38.390 --> 05:40.680
I want to see the trainees move.

05:40.680 --> 05:41.270
Sir.

05:41.950 --> 05:45.570
<i>Could this mean that he'll 
overlook my actions?</i>

05:48.230 --> 05:50.320
<i>Of course not.</i>

05:50.560 --> 05:54.750
So, what exactly are you trying to do here?

05:54.750 --> 05:57.100
Well, um...

05:57.810 --> 06:03.010
I am most pleased to meet you, Your Highness.

06:03.010 --> 06:06.220
That you would personally speak 
to a mere knight candidate

06:06.220 --> 06:09.050
makes me feel both humbled and delighted.

06:09.520 --> 06:10.800
Really?

06:10.800 --> 06:14.010
If you are not the person I think you are...

06:15.360 --> 06:19.310
then that would mean there is 
no issue with my touching you.

06:26.880 --> 06:29.730
Come now. Quickly, try to refute it.

06:30.970 --> 06:33.640
Prince Arnold, please step away for a moment!

06:33.640 --> 06:34.410
I refuse.

06:34.410 --> 06:36.880
If you continue, someone is sure to see!

06:36.880 --> 06:38.240
Is there some problem with that?

06:38.240 --> 06:39.280
Yes, there is!

06:39.280 --> 06:40.670
How so?

06:40.990 --> 06:45.420
Y-You have a fiancée, don't you?

06:48.190 --> 06:49.660
Well, yes, I do.

06:49.660 --> 06:51.550
You do, don't you? I thought so!

06:51.550 --> 06:53.050
Still...

06:53.050 --> 06:57.730
your manner of speech is quite disrespectful 
for a mere knight candidate.

06:58.930 --> 07:01.000
My deepest apologies.

07:01.000 --> 07:03.860
I don't know what it is 
you're apologizing for.

07:04.260 --> 07:07.550
Tell me with your own lips what you've done.

07:09.380 --> 07:12.940
I-I didn't tell Your Highness 
anything and dressed as a boy

07:12.940 --> 07:15.760
so I could join the knight 
candidates' training!

07:15.760 --> 07:17.830
I am truly, very sorry!

07:18.480 --> 07:19.700
Well done.

07:22.030 --> 07:24.750
But why are you doing this?

07:25.990 --> 07:27.080
Because...

07:28.420 --> 07:30.980
this training you've thought up...

07:30.980 --> 07:33.950
I wanted to undergo it, too.

07:39.620 --> 07:41.540
If you wish to continue, 
there are conditions.

07:43.000 --> 07:45.030
You must be sure to rest.

07:45.030 --> 07:48.300
And make sure that no one 
finds out your gender.

07:48.300 --> 07:48.870
What?

07:49.440 --> 07:50.560
Can you keep to those?

07:50.560 --> 07:52.650
Yes! Thank you!

07:55.720 --> 07:58.940
Are you enjoying this training that much?

07:58.940 --> 07:59.660
Yes!

08:00.040 --> 08:04.040
Prince Arnold, the training you've 
thought up is truly magnificent!

08:04.400 --> 08:07.920
Your intention to carefully help the 
knights to grow comes through clearly!

08:08.860 --> 08:11.280
Capable people are the empire's treasures.

08:15.040 --> 08:19.820
<i>But sending these knights into 
battle in the future will be...</i>

08:22.110 --> 08:26.000
I overheard your conversation 
with Prince Kyle.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.220
I'm sure you did.

08:28.000 --> 08:31.580
I believe I can predict what you're thinking.

08:32.330 --> 08:34.630
You believe that we should 
form an alliance with Coyolles

08:34.630 --> 08:36.820
and you're going to try to 
convince me, aren't you?

08:37.700 --> 08:41.400
But there is no value in a country 
that has lost all its power.

08:42.080 --> 08:44.880
When a nation's collapse 
is only a matter of time,

08:44.880 --> 08:47.710
the only question is how 
to deal the final blow.

08:49.760 --> 08:54.090
Prince Arnold, from time to time 
you are the most incredible liar.

08:55.680 --> 08:58.850
You're free to think 
whatever you like of me,

08:59.170 --> 09:00.250
but remember this...

09:01.180 --> 09:05.330
For this empire, war is not a cruel choice.

09:06.540 --> 09:08.670
It's simply one means of politics.

09:20.160 --> 09:24.510
<i>The first time I met Prince 
Kyle was when I was a trader.</i>

09:28.000 --> 09:29.290
In this rain,

09:29.590 --> 09:32.840
protecting your wares on the road 
must have been very difficult.

09:33.710 --> 09:35.890
Our kingdom lacks material resources.

09:35.890 --> 09:40.430
It's traders like you who support us and 
allow us to preserve our daily lives.

09:41.200 --> 09:45.680
I wish to express my deepest 
respect and gratitude to you.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.760
<i>Though he was a member of the royal family,</i>

09:47.760 --> 09:52.000
<i>he was someone who treated people 
of different stations with respect.</i>

09:53.990 --> 09:57.340
<i>The second time I met him was 
in my life as an herbalist.</i>

09:58.000 --> 10:00.920
<i>Then, too, he was someone who acted 
from his heart when dealing with me.</i>

10:01.590 --> 10:03.450
<i>And the third time...</i>

10:04.860 --> 10:07.250
I will speak with my father 
about the research funds.

10:07.770 --> 10:11.000
Because I know that 
you two will produce results.

10:11.770 --> 10:14.330
I swear that I will make him agree!

10:16.460 --> 10:17.630
It worked?

10:19.000 --> 10:20.170
Congratulations.

10:20.170 --> 10:23.970
More than anything else, the fact that your 
unwavering hard work has been rewarded

10:23.970 --> 10:25.670
makes me truly happy.

10:30.310 --> 10:32.900
<i>It's because Prince Kyle is like that...</i>

10:33.420 --> 10:34.460
<i>that I...</i>

10:40.640 --> 10:45.250
Your Highness, starting today, I'd like 
you to start taking these pills as well.

10:45.250 --> 10:48.040
Though, the flavor is just as awful.

10:48.370 --> 10:51.510
If it means that this body 
of mine will move properly,

10:51.510 --> 10:53.420
then it's nothing to me.

10:56.910 --> 11:00.320
Prince Kyle, the truth is that 
at the party the other evening,

11:00.320 --> 11:04.950
I happened to overhear your 
conversation with Prince Arnold.

11:06.830 --> 11:09.450
You saw me in a most embarrassing situation.

11:09.450 --> 11:12.970
In truth, the polite thing to do would 
have been to leave the country after that.

11:12.970 --> 11:16.320
However, I cannot afford to give up.

11:16.320 --> 11:19.510
Didn't you think that it might be dangerous?

11:19.510 --> 11:24.490
During the war, Prince Arnold beheaded 
members of royal families of enemy nations.

11:24.490 --> 11:25.870
You're aware of that, aren't you?

11:28.300 --> 11:31.880
Everything from the fruits of Prince 
Arnold's battles to his political measures...

11:31.880 --> 11:33.660
I've investigated everything I could.

11:34.240 --> 11:36.900
It seems to have been 
camouflaged very cleverly,

11:37.450 --> 11:39.810
but the care shown for the common 
people in domestic policies...

11:39.810 --> 11:42.840
I'm certain that it's his 
intention at work there.

11:43.440 --> 11:46.880
Killing the monarchs of enemy 
lands in the last war...

11:46.880 --> 11:50.730
it was done to prevent the seeds of further 
trouble. It was a form of compassion.

11:51.030 --> 11:52.580
That's how I think of it.

11:53.920 --> 11:55.960
And, the reality is...

11:56.560 --> 11:58.770
even if His Highness is a 
cruel and barbarous person,

11:59.320 --> 12:01.650
it doesn't change what I must do.

12:05.550 --> 12:08.000
I have a request to make of you, Prince Kyle.

12:09.510 --> 12:14.250
Won't you first form a 
modest alliance with me?

12:14.250 --> 12:15.740
An alliance?

12:16.770 --> 12:19.370
In order to convince Prince Arnold,

12:20.210 --> 12:22.470
I will need your strength.

12:34.640 --> 12:36.020
Thank you so much!

12:36.790 --> 12:39.780
Everything in it was incredibly intriguing!

12:40.180 --> 12:42.620
You love to learn, don't you?

12:42.620 --> 12:43.940
Yes, very much so!

12:44.460 --> 12:48.280
Learning new things, whatever they 
might be, makes me very excited.

12:48.280 --> 12:50.700
The world gets wider and wider,

12:50.700 --> 12:53.580
and even the view I saw yesterday 
looks different to me!

12:55.260 --> 12:56.960
That settles it for me.

12:58.550 --> 13:01.070
You aren't suited to be an empress.

13:02.480 --> 13:03.990
Professor...

13:03.990 --> 13:06.300
You should just come and join me.

13:06.870 --> 13:11.470
If you did, then if there were anything 
you didn't know, I would teach you.

13:11.470 --> 13:13.650
Thank you for your invitation,

13:13.650 --> 13:17.690
but I am here to marry Prince Arnold.

13:18.380 --> 13:20.690
Arnold Hein, is it?

13:21.360 --> 13:23.660
I understand why you're drawn to him.

13:24.880 --> 13:27.950
I'm interested in him, too.

13:29.670 --> 13:32.680
It seems he's turned down Kyle's request.

13:33.340 --> 13:36.960
And the reasons he gave for his refusal 
were exactly the sort of thing I love.

13:37.440 --> 13:42.060
If it were Arnold Hein, then I have the 
feeling that he'd use it quite effectively...

13:42.680 --> 13:47.470
this compound I've created, 
which I call black powder.

13:49.450 --> 13:51.280
I've been looking for so long!

13:51.760 --> 13:55.600
I never imagined that I'd meet 
the right person in this country.

13:58.680 --> 14:02.470
Despite his appearance, His 
Highness is a very kind person.

14:02.470 --> 14:05.820
Even if he said some harsh 
words to Prince Kyle,

14:05.820 --> 14:08.360
it's likely that he didn't truly—

14:07.110 --> 14:08.360
Say, Rishe!

14:08.360 --> 14:10.240
Will you help me meet with him?

14:11.150 --> 14:12.490
Of course.

14:12.850 --> 14:16.830
I'll see if he can make 
some time for you soon.

14:16.830 --> 14:18.620
Then, let's go and see him right now!

14:18.870 --> 14:22.200
His Highness is very 
busy, so a sudden visi—

14:21.470 --> 14:25.530
If he's as kind as you say, 
then I'm sure he'd forgive us.

14:26.590 --> 14:27.940
Well, that's...

14:27.940 --> 14:29.130
I understand.

14:29.600 --> 14:32.390
The truth is that you don't want 
me to meet with him, right?

14:37.900 --> 14:39.070
You...

14:39.730 --> 14:43.900
haven't asked me what 
black powder is, have you?

14:50.310 --> 14:53.240
<i>The professor told me all 
about black powder...</i>

14:53.710 --> 14:56.040
<i>back in my third life.</i>

14:56.360 --> 14:59.880
So, you won't cease your 
experiments, no matter what?

15:00.850 --> 15:02.290
I'm sorry, Rishe.

15:02.530 --> 15:06.210
Not even if it means that many 
people will lose their lives?

15:07.160 --> 15:11.610
"That which humans have created 
must be used the right way."

15:12.890 --> 15:15.100
There's a problem with this warning.

15:16.430 --> 15:22.210
Which is that no one can accurately 
define what "the right way" is.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.410
If this black powder of 
mine is used the right way,

15:29.410 --> 15:31.710
I'm sure that this world 
would easily be destroyed.

15:32.400 --> 15:35.580
But would that really be wrong?

15:37.710 --> 15:42.710
"How will the things I 
create change the world?"

15:42.990 --> 15:47.060
Is wanting to see that 
really such a bad thing?

15:49.560 --> 15:50.940
Professor...

15:55.950 --> 15:59.320
Farewell, my student.

16:01.460 --> 16:05.300
I sincerely hope that your life

16:05.760 --> 16:08.480
will unfold in a way that you feel is right.

16:12.160 --> 16:16.300
<i>I couldn't accept this black powder.</i>

16:18.100 --> 16:21.370
It will turn the world on 
its head and scramble it.

16:21.370 --> 16:26.380
I've been looking for a leader capable 
of using it for so very, very long!

16:27.000 --> 16:29.430
A leader like Arnold Hein.

16:39.210 --> 16:44.350
<i>I must find a way to establish friendly 
relations between Coyolles and Galkhein.</i>

16:44.350 --> 16:47.880
<i>And with Professor Michel in that state,</i>

16:47.880 --> 16:51.530
<i>he'll stop at nothing to 
approach Prince Arnold.</i>

16:51.530 --> 16:54.280
<i>If he does, then His Highness will 
use black powder in the war and—</i>

16:58.690 --> 17:00.380
Prince Theodore?

17:01.710 --> 17:04.460
I heard he found out. About 
you dressing as a boy.

17:07.010 --> 17:08.740
I'm very sorry.

17:09.180 --> 17:12.460
I had mixed feelings about you being 
able to completely deceive my brother,

17:12.460 --> 17:14.060
so I don't particularly mind.

17:14.630 --> 17:18.160
Still, the news reached you very quickly.

17:18.160 --> 17:20.920
Well, my retainers are 
outstanding, after all.

17:20.920 --> 17:24.520
Whatever my brother does, no matter 
where he is, I know about it right away.

17:24.520 --> 17:27.150
I have a perfect information network set up.

17:27.630 --> 17:29.580
And it isn't just my big 
brother I hear about.

17:30.130 --> 17:32.160
I've got my sister-in-law in there, too.

17:32.160 --> 17:35.390
I've already looked into the 
backgrounds of the knight candidates.

17:35.390 --> 17:38.970
If anything happened to you, I 
wouldn't know how to face my brother.

17:39.660 --> 17:41.600
Thank you!

17:41.600 --> 17:45.080
It's nothing. And it's not 
that I'm worried for you.

17:45.080 --> 17:47.380
I'm doing this for my brother.

17:48.850 --> 17:50.140
I understand.

17:54.670 --> 17:58.060
Actually, I have a favor to 
ask of you, Your Highness.

17:59.300 --> 18:03.930
May I borrow your outstanding 
retainers for a short while?

18:05.360 --> 18:08.610
Is it something that will help my brother?

18:08.610 --> 18:12.570
No. In fact, it would be an act of 
rebellion against Prince Arnold.

18:14.520 --> 18:15.970
I like it.

18:15.970 --> 18:18.370
Since it sounds like fun, I'll join you.

18:19.070 --> 18:21.580
Then, we've come to an understanding.

18:38.060 --> 18:40.520
Because you were born,

18:40.520 --> 18:42.710
my wife is dead.

18:44.380 --> 18:47.100
Which is why you must atone.

18:48.430 --> 18:52.750
You were born to bring us misfortune, 
you harbinger of death!

18:55.880 --> 18:57.610
<i>Whether I was hungry...</i>

18:57.860 --> 18:59.230
<i>or I was lonely...</i>

18:59.760 --> 19:02.510
<i>the field of learning always accepted me.</i>

19:04.160 --> 19:08.220
<i>Knowledge swiftly entered my 
mind and settled into my body.</i>

19:09.120 --> 19:13.330
<i>It was just like breathing, 
or drinking water.</i>

19:14.600 --> 19:17.880
This child has inherited my genius.

19:18.650 --> 19:21.410
Use him as much as you like in my place.

19:21.410 --> 19:25.220
<i>After being allowed into the 
laboratory, my world expanded.</i>

19:26.430 --> 19:30.160
<i>If I wanted to know something and 
performed enough experiments...</i>

19:30.160 --> 19:32.550
<i>my efforts would always be repaid.</i>

19:33.560 --> 19:36.270
What is going on here?

19:36.270 --> 19:41.070
To think he'd be so adept at making
 something that would kill people...

19:41.700 --> 19:44.180
<i>After some time, a war broke out.</i>

19:45.200 --> 19:47.040
<i>Everything burned.</i>

19:48.430 --> 19:50.630
<i>All of the alchemists in the laboratory...</i>

19:51.070 --> 19:54.700
<i>everyone, including my 
father, lost their lives.</i>

19:59.360 --> 20:01.800
<i>It was by chance that I created it.</i>

20:02.930 --> 20:06.410
<i>A compound capable of destroying everything.</i>

20:11.880 --> 20:14.940
<i>That was black powder.</i>

20:16.400 --> 20:19.280
You truly are a harbinger of death.

20:20.630 --> 20:22.630
<i>It's just as my father said.</i>

20:22.630 --> 20:26.600
<i>It seems I've been born to 
bring misfortune to others.</i>

20:41.670 --> 20:46.390
<i>In the past, I was unable to 
convince Professor Michel.</i>

20:51.300 --> 20:52.640
Professor...

20:55.230 --> 20:56.680
Well, hello, Rishe.

20:57.600 --> 21:00.380
Have you managed to find a 
way for me to meet with him?

21:02.520 --> 21:08.120
Professor, do you truly intend to 
give black powder to Prince Arnold?

21:12.390 --> 21:14.660
If something has been born as a poison,

21:14.660 --> 21:17.630
then only in fulfilling its task
 will it find its true place.

21:19.570 --> 21:24.310
Everything, no matter what, must fulfill 
the role for which it was born.

21:26.710 --> 21:29.190
My own existence is the same.

21:29.850 --> 21:33.100
A person who was born to 
upset the ways of the world

21:33.370 --> 21:36.430
must act in accordance with that duty.

21:37.800 --> 21:41.930
<i>Even back in my third life, the 
professor said these same things.</i>

21:43.360 --> 21:48.300
Even if many people will 
lose their lives for it?

21:48.300 --> 21:49.420
That's right.

21:50.240 --> 21:52.540
Black powder's reason for being...

21:52.540 --> 21:54.710
is to bring misfortune to others.

21:59.440 --> 22:01.120
I'm sorry, Rishe.

22:01.120 --> 22:03.700
It isn't that I want to 
say mean things to you.

22:04.380 --> 22:06.420
That's the honest truth.

22:09.680 --> 22:13.120
This is the calling I've been given.

22:16.970 --> 22:20.810
<i>I'm certain that the professor will 
use any means necessary to give</i>

22:20.810 --> 22:22.350
<i>black powder to Prince Arnold.</i>

22:24.490 --> 22:26.440
Good night, Rishe.

22:29.070 --> 22:30.500
<i>If things keep going this way...</i>

22:31.070 --> 22:34.000
<i>I won't be able to stop the professor.</i>
